// CF-2 (t_91bbd575): the canonical conditional discard.
//
// The reference compiles this to exactly three instructions - the varying
// load, a comparison whose destination is the CONDITION register with
// cc_update set (no general register written), and KIL testing NE on lane
// x.  Nine of the twelve CF-2 witnesses are this shape.
//
// Measured against the reference before this fixture was written.
void main(float4 c : TEXCOORD0, out float4 o : COLOR)
{
    if (c.a < 0.5) discard;
    o = c;
}
